    "body": "Oh good call. Per https://dontcallmedom.github.io/webdex/a.html#AbstractRange%40%40%40%40interface and in particular https://dontcallmedom.github.io/webdex/c.html#collapsed@@AbstractRange@attribute this would break https://w3c.github.io/editing/docs/execCommand/#effectively-contained. Although arguably that is in violation of the rule that you cannot define an algorithm in terms of public API. cc @zcorpan \r\n\r\nI can create a patch for that tomorrow. I think the observable differences will be covered by the generated IDL tests, but I should also mention that in the eventual commit message for clarity.",
